WEBVTT

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.040
I remember now.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:33.010
I won't forgive anyone who takes from me!

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.390
We are the swords of salvation.

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:45.810
We are the Saviors!

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:47.100
Write!

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.430
<b>Dance, dance, God of Thunder</b>

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.270
<b>Come, thunder; come, lightning.</b>

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:58.990
Clench those ass muscles, you bastards.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.980
<b>None in this world live forever. Enjoy the moment and live for pleasure.</b>

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:04.330
England Headquarters will face the left wing.

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:08.320
<b>Destroy everything in the blink of an eye.</b>

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:14.300
Don't let your guard down, Edward-sama.

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:18.250
<b>Do not be left with regrets. It is time for the killing spree.</b>

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:21.970
Long nails!

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:34.520
<b>Die, die, die, die</b>

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:36.480
Freezing Shade.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:44.110
<b>Purge all life, enlightenment comes easily.</b>

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:49.030
<b>Share with all this lightness, this uplift, this freedom, this joy</b>

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:56.460
Step Eight Dark Art, Thunderstorm Helix!

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:07.750
Thanks, everyone.

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:16.600
Moroha-san.

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:25.160
<i>I believe that hope exists in 
the despair of certain death.</i>

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:31.250
<i>Like a speck of gold dust 
buried in a gray gravel.</i>

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:36.420
<b>Half a Year Ago</b>

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:40.800
I believe you've already been informed.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:45.000
You are all special people 
chosen from across Japan.

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:49.070
You've inherited the memories 
of your previous lives,

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:52.690
and you are able to use the miraculous 
power of the Ancestral Arts.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:55.400
You may hesitate at first.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.450
It may be difficult.

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.700
But you must never give up.

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:06.350
I want you to become Saviors that 
can break down the Metaphysicals.

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:11.080
That is what I, Principal Shimon Mari, 
and the other teachers wish for.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:14.670
That's what you get

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:19.020
for falling asleep at the 
entrance ceremony, you failure.

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:22.720
I hate people who don't try.

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:26.280
Sarasha?

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:29.440
Flaga...

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:39.000
Flaga!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.150
I missed you, Flaga!

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:42.490
Wait, I'm Moroha.

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:43.420
Haimura Moroha.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.460
No, you're my brother, Flaga.

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:48.620
You called my name.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:52.820
No, actually, I have almost 
no memory of my past life.

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:53.600
Really?

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:57.280
The name Sarasha just popped up in my head.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.290
Oh.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:01.700
Oh, then maybe I should head-butt you again.

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:03.160
No!

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:06.870
What happened?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.070
Maybe she's anemic or something.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:11.490
Are you all right?

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.030
Shu Saura.

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:18.210
Morning, dear.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:22.670
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh—

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:24.660
What are you doing?!

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.490
You have me, your sister!

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:27.710
I didn't expect that.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:29.430
Don't fall asleep!

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:31.710
Hey, wake up, you homewrecker!

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:35.180
What do you think you're 
doing, messing with my Flaga?

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.160
I had the wrong person.

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:39.190
You'd kiss the wrong person by accident?

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:40.830
I was half asleep.

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:42.940
You kiss people half asleep?

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:45.900
What are you so upset about?

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:48.860
I've never done it before in this life!

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.720
How could you steal my turn?

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:52.110
There, there, you two.

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:54.290
What did you think of my lips?

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:56.160
You want my feedback?!

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:59.590
Aren't you in shock or something?

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:01.760
It's not a big deal.

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:02.700
It is.

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:03.670
How so?

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:06.420
You're devaluing women.

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.760
You're interesting.

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:13.310
Why are you flirting?

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.220
How can you leave your sister out?

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.570
You can't even remember me.

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:20.020
Nii-sama, you idiot! Loser! Sly bastard!

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:21.750
What?

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:23.370
You were always the ladies' man!

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:32.240
All right, let's start with introductions.

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:33.950
Me, me!

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:36.200
Um, you're...

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:39.070
Student Number 30.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:40.470
Ranjou Satsuki.

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:43.920
I'm going to work hard to become the 
second strongest Savior at school.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:46.210
Follow me, everyone!

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:55.740
I don't even know who you are. 
Why should I follow you?

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:57.640
Aren't we going in order of student number?

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:05.480
Come on, I was just setting an example 
because you're all as quiet as cats.

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:07.070
Who do you think you are?

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:08.720
Know your place!

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:09.260
<i>What're you doing?</i>

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:12.960
Sensei, we're running out of time.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:14.710
Let's continue the introductions.

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:16.200
Oh, sure thing,

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:20.310
We're all in the same class. 
Let's all get along, shall we?

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:23.790
Okay, Student Number One, please.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.210
Um...

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:30.970
Urushibara Shizuno-san.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:31.970
What's wrong?

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:36.430
Are you still sleeping?!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.180
<b>Girls' Changing Room</b>

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:40.790
Jeez, everyone's so mean.

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:44.110
Just watch me, I'll waste 
them in the practicals.

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:48.230
And then, and then, Nii-sama will praise me.

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:53.650
Yes. Our love won't be a taboo this time!

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:05.580
Hey, Onii-sama.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:07.970
Let's go on a date after school.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:15.840
I was thinking of going job hunting.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.810
This school doesn't let 
you have part-time jobs.

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:20.350
Seriously?

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:23.980
Wh-What was that?

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:26.900
The coliseum is a disjointed space.

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:32.280
Even if you get injured in here, 
you'll be fine once you leave.

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:35.520
You know a lot.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.060
There are two kinds of Saviors.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:46.790
Shirogane, who use Light skills,

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.020
and Dark Mages, who use Dark Arts.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.720
Today, I'll teach you 
how to use Light skills.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.190
What was that?

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:02.390
He's shining.

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:05.700
This is the Plana, 
the source of Light skills.

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:07.870
How did you do that?

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:09.520
I want to try, too.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:12.280
You all have memories of your past lives.

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:19.550
So you should know how you used to 
bring out the Plana intuitively.

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:21.240
Got it.

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:23.420
All right, let's do this!

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:29.290
Something <i>else</i> is going to come out.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:36.790
Ranjou-san.

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.390
From both hands, right off the bat?

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:40.740
Wait, no.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:45.260
See what you can do when you channel 
your Plana into your arms.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.840
I'm light to begin with.

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:49.610
Really.

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:55.230
I'm so dizzy.

00:09:55.230 --> 00:09:56.350
Sorry.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:00.560
Did you see that, Nii-sama?

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:04.980
This class is so pointless.

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:08.000
If only a Metaphysical would 
go on a rampage or something.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.540
What makes you say that?

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:12.650
If it's bad enough that people get killed,

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:15.510
they'd let a first-year like me join in, too.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:16.550
I see.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:20.300
Hey, you.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.070
Huh?

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:26.240
You're scum. You bring shame to the Saviors.

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:30.380
What gives you the right 
to call me scum, shrimp?

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:35.480
Put your hand on your heart 
and recall what you just said.

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:41.660
Are you one of those "I'm a 
hero of justice" type people?

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:46.830
You smell. Go stuff your 
head in the incinerator.

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:49.330
What was that?

00:10:53.070 --> 00:10:54.010
Wow.

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:55.290
It came from his whole body.

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:58.630
Hey, you two, stop fighting.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:03.360
Hey, Sensei, there're two 
of us that can use Plana.

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:05.470
How about a practice round?

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:08.750
But it's our first day. 
A practical might not be a good idea.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.350
I'd like to, too.

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:19.670
Are you ready?

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:23.620
Show me your power of justice.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:27.370
Yeah, I'll teach you what a 
real Savior is, you failure.

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:41.950
Come, Arciel.

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:47.260
What the...

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:49.650
By channeling your Plana into your dog tag,

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:51.770
it becomes a weapon you 
used in your past life.

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.150
Wow.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:56.520
Is she going to be all right?

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:09.330
What's wrong?

00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:11.910
Watch this.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:27.760
Pick it up.

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:29.790
Don't be polite.

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:32.670
This match is supposed to be 
an example for everyone else.

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:34.270
Let's start again.

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:39.020
I'll make sure you're sorry!

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:11.770
Are you all right, Satsuki?

00:13:13.190 --> 00:13:15.620
You're that scum that couldn't 
even bring out Plana.

00:13:17.800 --> 00:13:21.030
You're both scum. You make a good couple.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:23.130
That's enough, Isurugi-kun.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:27.530
You win the round, but I don't 
condone bullying the weak.

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:29.740
Sorry.

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:34.540
Hear that, Ranjou? You're weak.

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:37.670
Satsuki.

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:43.210
The weak will always lose to 
the strong. Remember that.

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:08.660
Cheer up.

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:14.490
I don't know anything about being a Savior,

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:16.160
but aren't you better if

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:18.870
you have good intentions 
than if you're strong?

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:22.840
I...

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:28.010
The city where I lived was constantly 
under attack by Metaphysicals.

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:30.390
I had to move many times.

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:33.100
I see.

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:38.210
I couldn't make too many 
friends because of that,

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:41.110
but I wasn't lonely at all.

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:47.310
I had Sarasha's memories, and I met 
Flaga in my dreams every night.

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:52.130
I took the test and found out I was a Savior,

00:14:52.130 --> 00:14:55.040
and I found out that I wasn't 
the only one with a past life.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:15:01.100
I learned there's a school for 
Saviors, and I thought just maybe.

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:02.130
Just maybe?

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:06.960
Just maybe I might meet Nii-sama.

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:08.490
That's me?

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:15.400
All that stuff about justice and 
saving the world is secondary to me.

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:19.540
I just wanted to look good in front 
of you and have you praise me.

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:21.730
That's all I wished for.

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.410
I can't talk about Isurugi.

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:28.580
Seeing him is like seeing all 
the things I hate about myself.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:30.030
I couldn't take it.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:31.740
So I picked a fight and lost.

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.860
I'm pathetic.

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:39.250
Please, Nii-sama, scold me.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.220
Lecture me like you used to.

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:43.300
I'll listen to anything you have to say.

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:48.460
I'll scold you, then.

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:53.260
Why? Did you invite her?

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:59.020
You're one homewrecker, 
sneaking out on a date.

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:00.990
What?

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:04.050
Why are you taking my fries?

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:07.310
You're too depressed to eat, aren't you?

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:09.430
I'm eating them for you.

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:11.790
I guess we shouldn't let them go to waste.

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:19.540
That's not the point.

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:21.970
We were siblings in our past lives.

00:16:21.970 --> 00:16:24.030
We have so much to catch up on.

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:26.540
You just met us. Go away, stranger.

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:29.000
I can't do that.

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:32.260
Does this devalue women, too?

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:37.260
What are you doing, exactly?

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:41.510
It feels <i>that</i> good, huh?

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:44.270
Nii-sama, you idiot!

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:48.760
Freak! Pervert! How could 
you be so dirty in public?

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:50.230
Do you like boobs <i>that</i> much?

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:53.390
Are they worth committing 
social suicide for?

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:56.430
You, too, Urushibara.

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:58.760
Using your lady parts to seduce men.

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:00.300
Have you no shame?

00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:04.750
I don't think you should get jealous, 
just because you don't have lady parts.

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:08.410
I have lady parts, too!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:13.510
Sorry, I shouldn't have said that.

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.510
Please don't apologize like you mean it.

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:21.520
You're right, there are some things 
that just shouldn't be said.

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:24.520
I'm not that miserable!

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:29.020
But don't worry, we're both growing still.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:32.030
Don't pity me after all that!

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:36.790
Fine. I feel sorry for you, so I'll 
lend him to you for a little bit.

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:41.990
There, Moroha, do you like that?

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:45.190
Tell me honestly what you 
think of my lady parts.

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:47.540
Don't be shy just because we're siblings.

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.540
Ow, ow!

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:49.160
You're too bony!

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:53.210
I don't care about you anymore!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.800
You sly bastard!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.660
Thanks, Urushibara.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:00.550
Huh?

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:04.620
Satsuki seems a bit better now.

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:07.270
You really came to cheer her up, didn't you?

00:18:07.610 --> 00:18:08.770
I...

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:11.450
No, it's still too early.

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:16.650
Well, then.

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:31.890
What did you want, calling me out here?

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:35.460
Apologize to Ranjou, to Satsuki.

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:37.260
Huh?

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:41.970
I get it.

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:44.260
Choose one you like.

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:47.090
That's what you wanted, isn't it?

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:52.230
Sure, I'll apologize.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:58.150
But only if you can hit me at least once!

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:13.410
Jeez, that Urushibara girl.

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:15.720
But...

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:20.980
Nii-sama was so kind.

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:22.430
Just like in the past life.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:27.700
Ranjou-san, come quick.

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:28.590
Moroha is...

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:40.300
Dude, I only bumped you.

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:41.860
You flew way too far.

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:45.620
I can't read his moves.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:47.620
He's fast, isn't he?

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:49.620
Isurugi-kun's Jinsokutsu!

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:54.250
Which one is it?

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:55.840
Over here.

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:04.350
Moroha!

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:10.100
Perfect. Ranjou's here, too.

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:15.730
After I crush you, we can 
pick up where we left off.

00:20:16.030 --> 00:20:18.000
It won't be just your outerwear this time.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:20.180
I'll tear it all off.

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:25.660
Apologize!

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:27.410
Apologize!

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:32.040
Shut up!

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:15.080
Moroha.

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:16.480
No.

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:18.340
Are you going to lose?

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:20.380
Keep your head up, Ranjou-san.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:26.320
Moroha is fighting for you.

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:29.980
So you have the obligation 
to watch him until it's over.

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:33.520
I won't let you look away.

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:36.810
Sorry.

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:40.300
Come on!

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:41.780
Right! Left!

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:44.240
Keep up, or I'll hit you!

00:21:54.760 --> 00:21:58.460
This is fun, isn't it, Haimura?

00:22:02.240 --> 00:22:05.470
You're right, you surely 
won't lose, Nii-sama.

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:09.270
You're the guardian of the holy 
sword—the most powerful knight!

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:16.520
You won't lose, Nii-sama.

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:20.020
You're the guardian of the holy sword.

00:22:20.530 --> 00:22:23.030
The most powerful knight!

00:22:29.340 --> 00:22:31.760
No matter how arduous the battlefield,

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:33.660
no matter how formidable my enemy,

00:22:34.130 --> 00:22:38.170
I will always win and come home to you.

00:22:45.250 --> 00:22:49.080
It's over!

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:51.570
I'll give you a kiss if you win!

00:22:55.270 --> 00:22:57.480
I remember now.

00:22:59.900 --> 00:23:02.150
Come, Saratiga!

00:23:16.900 --> 00:23:18.580
You! Stop!

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:24.400
Jinsokutsu?!

00:23:24.400 --> 00:23:27.160
It took me two years to master it.

00:23:28.790 --> 00:23:32.490
You've only just awoken to Plana!

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:48.150
Someone, get aid!

00:23:49.630 --> 00:23:50.740
Moroha.

00:23:51.280 --> 00:23:52.820
What did

00:23:53.440 --> 00:23:54.240
I just...

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:57.450
Moroha! Moroha!

00:23:59.420 --> 00:24:01.460
Ancient Dragon.

00:24:02.810 --> 00:24:04.210
A dragon from long ago.

00:24:04.210 --> 00:24:06.960
<i>Or the oldest spirit of the war dead.</i>

00:24:07.200 --> 00:24:09.720
<i>When I heard those words from Mari-oneechan,</i>

00:24:09.720 --> 00:24:13.750
<i>I felt a strange throbbing in my chest.</i>

00:24:14.930 --> 00:24:24.730
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:15.750 --> 00:24:19.780
Wait, Nii-sama, what do you 
mean I'm so bony it hurts?

00:24:19.780 --> 00:24:20.810
Your ribs, I guess.

00:24:20.810 --> 00:24:22.840
Next time, "Imbue My Sword, Magic Flame!"

00:24:22.840 --> 00:24:24.940
Break through the stormy current life!
